{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Span","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Roughly forty tag names are the "},{"code":"…Begin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"…End","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"halves of about fifteen base tags — "},{"code":"\\slurBegin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"\\slurEnd","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\crescBegin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"\\crescEnd","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"\\tieBegin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"\\tieEnd","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and so on. Rather"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"than give each half its own payload, one payload carries a "},{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/whole","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":": the range form, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\slur(c d e)"},{"type":"text","text":" — the tag owns a body."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/begin","type":"reference"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/end","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": the open form, ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\slurBegin c d \\slurEnd","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"optionally paired by a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Ident-swift.struct"},{"type":"text","text":" suffix."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"The-two-forms-are-never-interchanged","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"The two forms are never interchanged"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Begin"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"End"},{"type":"text","text":" pair is not rewritten into a range, nor a range into a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pair, on grounds of totality: open spans may overlap or go"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"unterminated, and a range is a tree that can express neither.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A real score may contain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\slurBegin:1 \\beam( b\/16 \\crescBegin c3 d e&) \\slurEnd:1 \\crescEnd"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which interleaves three spans across the beam’s range. Restricting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rewrite to the safe subset would be worse than not doing it: identical","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"fragments would format differently depending on distant context.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"An-end-carries-no-parameters","text":"An `end` carries no parameters"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…End"},{"type":"text","text":" name takes no parameters at all. A payload whose span is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/end","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" therefore refuses typed parameters, and none is ever emitted."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Parameters written on an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"…End"},{"text":" tag keep it reserved","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through the parser, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" drops them —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/droppedSpanEndParameters(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" — so the tag"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"promotes on the second pass."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"IvorGMN","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Span"}],"title":"GMNTag.Span","externalID":"s:7IvorGMN6GMNTagO4SpanO","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Span"}],"symbolKind":"enum"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmntag\/span-swift.enum"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Which part of a spanning construct a Guido Music Notation tag is."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration